# Image Assets

Place all images in this directory.

## Required Images

1. `profile.jpg` - Main profile photo
   - URL: https://res.cloudinary.com/dye5qpwii/image/upload/v1778527878/IMG_20260430_053105_uef0yr.png

2. `og-image.jpg` - Social share image
   - URL: https://res.cloudinary.com/dye5qpwii/image/upload/v1778747388/image-1_1_khsx9s.png

3. Project screenshots (optional but recommended)

## Image Optimization

- Use WebP format when possible
- Compress images before upload
- Keep file size under 200KB
- Maintain aspect ratio
